y the mob decides to close the loop, sending back Joe's future self for assassination.","description_fr":"Dans un futur proche, la Mafia a mis au point un système infaillible pour faire disparaître tous les témoins gênants. Elle expédie ses victimes dans le passé, à notre époque, où des tueurs d’un genre nouveau (les « Loopers ») les éliminent.  Un jour, l’un d’entre eux, Joe, découvre que la victime qu’il doit exécuter n’est autre que… lui-même, avec 30 ans de plus. La machine si bien huilée déraille…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNjL6SqErDBE8OUZlrDLkexfsCj.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GPCnwvTbsDleH5QIOyDLMsK8a2.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.9,"vote_count":11360,"age_rating":"R","year":"2012","release_date":"2012-09-26","runtime_minutes":118,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حركة","إثارة","خيال علمي","دراما","أكشن","خيالي علمي"],"genre_keys":["action","thriller","scifi","drama"],"similar":["mv119450","mv78","mv912649","mv514345","mv117251","mv412656","mv2207","mv471513"],"director":"ريان جونسون","cast":[{"name":"جوزيف غوردون-ليفيت","character":"Joe","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z2FA8js799xqtfiFjBTicFYdfk.jpg"},{"name":"Bruce Willis","character":"Old Joe","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w3aXr1e7gQCn8MSp1vW4sXHn99P.jpg"},{"name":"إيميلي بلنت","character":"Sara","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5nCSG5TL1bP1geD8aaBfaLnLLCD.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Dano","character":"Seth","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/idiW4qPI4wuP21CFARoRnES2qxC.jpg"},{"name":"نوح سيغان","character":"Kid Blue","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/j1mjH6uOZlKaiQ18U4SaTnmnjMl.jpg"},{"name":"بايبر بيرابو","character":"Suzie","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5XrzISDEox0KubRDzJU668Oxmxy.jpg"},{"name":"جيف دانييلز","character":"Abe","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/r0mkZJZnTSJO3HJRsMW5HtszxE8.jpg"},{"name":"Pier